@startuml
!include _style.puml
left to right direction
title 图 4-1b 关键领域设计类（概念到设计的抽象）
class Application <<entity>> {
  id / code
  enabled
  验证可用()
}
class Role <<entity>> {
  code
  enabled
  选择权限()
}
class Permission <<entity>> {
  code
  resource / action
}
class User <<entity>> {
  externalId
  enabled / contextVersion
}
class Department <<entity>> {
  code / name
}
class RoleAssignment <<entity>> {
  grantId
  expiresAt
  判断有效()
}
class PermissionContext <<entity>> {
  tokenHash
  expiresAt / contextVersion
  验证当前状态()
}
class EffectivePermissions <<value object>> {
  roleSet / permissionSet
  refreshAt
  逐项判断()
}
Application "1" o-- "0..*" Role : 软件拥有
Application "1" o-- "0..*" Permission : 共享定义
Role "0..*" -- "0..*" Permission : 同软件选择
User "0..*" -- "0..*" Department : 组织成员
User "1" -- "0..*" RoleAssignment
Role "1" -- "0..*" RoleAssignment
User "1" -- "0..*" PermissionContext
Application "1" -- "0..*" PermissionContext
PermissionContext "0..*" -- "0..*" Role : 激活子集
PermissionContext ..> EffectivePermissions : 按当前事实求值
note bottom of RoleAssignment
新授权 / 续期改变 grantId
旧复核仅匹配原授予实例
end note
note bottom of Department
部门不拥有角色或权限
无部门用户也可授权
end note
note bottom of EffectivePermissions
当前以 JDBC + record/Map 实现
本图不是已有 JPA Entity 类清单
end note
@enduml
